#. general welcome message help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:39
msgid ""
"<p><b>Welcome Message</b><br>\n"
"Specify the name of a file containing the\n"
"text to display when someone connects to the server.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ຂໍ້ຄວາມຕ້ອນຮັບ</b><br>\n"
"ລະບຸຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີ\n"
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອມີຜູ້ໃດຜູ້ໜຶ່ງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. general chroot  help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:46
msgid ""
"<p><b>Chroot</b><br>\n"
"When enabled, local users will be (by default) placed in a \n"
"chroot() jail in their home directory after login.\n"
"<b>Warning:</b> This option has security implications, \n"
"especially if users have upload permission\n"
"or shell access. Only enable Chroot if you know what you are doing.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Chroot</b><br>\n"
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ (ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ) ຢູ່ໃນ \n"
"chroot() jail ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຂອງພວກເຂົາຫຼັງຈາກເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ.\n"
"<b>ຄຳເຕືອນ:</b> ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມປອດໄພ, \n"
"ໂດຍສະເພາະຖ້າຜູ້ໃຊ້ມີສິດອັບໂຫຼດ ຫຼື ເຂົ້າເຖິງ shell. \n"
"ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ Chroot ຖ້າທ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. general logging  help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:56
msgid ""
"<p><b>Verbose Logging</b><br>\n"
"When enabled, all FTP requests and responses are logged.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ການບັນທຶກເຫດການແບບລະອຽດ</b><br>\n"
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້, ທຸກໆການຮ້ອງຂໍ ແລະ ການຕອບກັບຂອງ FTP ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. general umask for anonymous  help
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:62
msgid ""
"<p><b>Umask for Anonymous:</b><br>\n"
"The value to which the umask for file creation is set for anonymous users. \n"
"If you want to specify octal values, remember the \"0\" prefix, otherwise \n"
"the value will be treated as a base 10 integer.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Umask ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປ:</b><br>\n"
"ຄ່າ umask ສຳລັບການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປ. \n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການລະບຸຄ່າຖານແປດ, ຢ່າລືມໃສ່ \"0\" ທາງໜ້າ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ \n"
"ຄ່າຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນເປັນເລກຖານ 10.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. general umask for authenticated users  help
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:70
msgid ""
"<p><b>Umask for Authenticated Users:</b><br>\n"
"The value to which the umask for file creation is set for authenticated "
"users. \n"
"If you want to specify octal values, remember the \"0\" prefix, otherwise \n"
"the value will be treated as a base 10 integer.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Umask ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຜ່ານການຢັ້ງຢືນ:</b><br>\n"
"ຄ່າ umask ສຳລັບການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຜ່ານການຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນ. \n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການລະບຸຄ່າຖານແປດ, ຢ່າລືມໃສ່ \"0\" ທາງໜ້າ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ \n"
"ຄ່າຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນເປັນເລກຖານ 10.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. general FTP dir for anonymous help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:78
msgid ""
"<p><b>FTP Directory for Anonymous Users:</b><br>\n"
"Specify a directory which is used for FTP anonymous users. \n"
"Press <b>Browse</b> to select a directory from the local filesystem.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ FTP ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປ:</b><br>\n"
"ລະບຸໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ FTP ແບບທົ່ວໄປ. \n"
"ກົດ <b>ເລືອກເບິ່ງ</b> ເພື່ອເລືອກໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໃນເຄື່ອງ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. general FTP dir for authenticated help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:85
msgid ""
"<p><b>FTP Directory for Authenticated Users:</b><br>\n"
"Specify a directory which is used for FTP authenticated users. \n"
"Press <b>Browse</b> to select a directory from the local filesystem.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ FTP ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຜ່ານການຢັ້ງຢືນ:</b><br>\n"
"ລະບຸໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ FTP ທີ່ຜ່ານການຢັ້ງຢືນ. \n"
"ກົດ <b>ເລືອກເບິ່ງ</b> ເພື່ອເລືອກໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໃນເຄື່ອງ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. -----------================= PERFORMANCE SCREEN =============----------
#.
#. performance  Max Idle Time  help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:95
msgid ""
"<p><b>Max Idle Time:</b><br>\n"
"The maximum time (timeout) a remote client \n"
"may wait between FTP commands.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ເວລາພັກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສູງສຸດ:</b><br>\n"
"ເວລາສູງສຸດ (timeout) ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈາກພາຍນອກ \n"
"ສາມາດລໍຖ້າລະຫວ່າງຄຳສັ່ງ FTP.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. performance max clients per IP  help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:102
msgid ""
"<p><b>Max Clients for One IP:</b><br>\n"
"The maximum number of clients allowed to connect\n"
"from the same source internet address. \n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ຈຳນວນຜູ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສູງສຸດຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງ IP:</b><br>\n"
"ຈຳນວນຜູ້ໃຊ້ສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່\n"
"ຈາກທີ່ຢູ່ອິນເຕີເນັດ (IP) ດຽວກັນ. \n"
"</p>\n"

#. performance max clients help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:109
msgid ""
"<p><b>Max Clients:</b><br>\n"
"The maximum number of clients allowed to connect. \n"
"Any additional clients trying to connect will get an error message.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ຈຳນວນຜູ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສູງສຸດ:</b><br>\n"
"ຈຳນວນຜູ້ໃຊ້ສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່. \n"
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃດໆທີ່ພະຍາຍາມເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເກີນກວ່ານີ້ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. performance local max rate help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:116
msgid ""
"<p><b>Local Max Rate:</b><br>\n"
"The maximum data transfer rate permitted for local authenticated users.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ອັດຕາການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນສູງສຸດ:</b><br>\n"
"ອັດຕາການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນທີ່ຜ່ານການຢັ້ງຢືນ.\n"
"</p>"

#. performance  anonymous max rate help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:122
msgid ""
"<p><b>Anonymous Max Rate:</b><br>\n"
"The maximum data transfer rate permitted for anonymous clients.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ອັດຕາການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນສູງສຸດສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປ:</b><br>\n"
"ອັດຕາການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປ.</p>\n"

#. -----------================= Authentication SCREEN =============----------
#.
#. authentication  Enable/Disable Anonymous and Local help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:129
msgid ""
"<p><b>Enable/Disable Anonymous and Local Users</b><br>\n"
"<b>Anonymous Only</b>: If enabled, only anonymous logins are permitted.\n"
"<b>Authenticated Users Only</b>: If enabled, only authenticated users are "
"permitted.\n"
"<b>Both</b> If enabled, authenticated users and anonymous users are "
"permitted.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ເປີດ/ປິດ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ</b><br>\n"
"<b>ສະເພາະຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປ</b>: ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສະເພາະການເຂົ້າລະບົບແບບທົ່ວໄປເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"<b>ສະເພາະຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຜ່ານການຢັ້ງຢືນ</b>: ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສະເພາະຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຜ່ານການຢັ້ງຢືນເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"<b>ທັງສອງຢ່າງ</b>: ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທັງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຜ່ານການຢັ້ງຢືນ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. authentication  Enable Upload help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:137
msgid ""
"<p><b>Enable Upload</b><br>\n"
"If enabled, FTP users can upload. To allow anonymous users \n"
"to upload, enable <b>Anonymous Can Upload</b>.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ເປີດການອັບໂຫຼດ</b><br>\n"
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ FTP ຈະສາມາດອັບໂຫຼດໄດ້. ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປ \n"
"ອັບໂຫຼດໄດ້, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ <b>ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປສາມາດອັບໂຫຼດໄດ້</b>.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. authentication Anonymous Can Upload help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:144
msgid ""
"<p><b>Anonymous Can Upload</b><br>\n"
"If enabled anonymous users will be permitted to upload.\n"
"<i>vsftpd only: </i>If you want to allow anonymous users to upload, you \n"
"need an existing directory with write permission in the home directory after "
"login.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປສາມາດອັບໂຫຼດໄດ້</b><br>\n"
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປຈະໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ອັບໂຫຼດ.\n"
"<i>ສະເພາະ vsftpd: </i>ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປອັບໂຫຼດໄດ້, ທ່ານ \n"
"ຕ້ອງມີໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ມີສິດຂຽນຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຫຼັງຈາກເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. authentication Anonymous Can Create Dirs help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:152
msgid ""
"<p><b>Anonymous Can Create Dirs</b><br>\n"
"If enabled, anonymous users can create directories.\n"
"<i>vsftpd only:</i> If you want to allow anonymous users to create "
"directories,\n"
"you need an existing directory with write permission in the home directory "
"after login.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປສາມາດສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໄດ້</b><br>\n"
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປຈະສາມາດສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໄດ້.\n"
"<i>ສະເພາະ vsftpd:</i> ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໄດ້, \n"
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ມີສິດຂຽນຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຫຼັງຈາກເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ.</p>\n"

#. -----------================= EXPERT SETTINGS SCREEN =============----------
#.
#. expert settings Enable Passive Mode help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:162
msgid ""
"<p><b>Enable Passive Mode</b><br>\n"
"If enabled, the FTP server will allow passive mode for connections.   \n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດ Passive</b><br>\n"
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ເຊີເວີ FTP ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂໝດ passive ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. expert settings Min Port for Pas. Mode help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:168
msgid ""
"<p><b>Min Port for Passive Mode</b><br>\n"
"Minimum value for a port range for passive connection replies.\n"
"This is used for protection by means of a firewall. \n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ພອດຕໍ່າສຸດສຳລັບໂໝດ Passive</b><br>\n"
"ຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງພອດສຳລັບການຕອບກັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບ passive.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອການປ້ອງກັນຜ່ານໄຟວໍ (firewall).\n"
"</p>\n"

#. expert settings Max Port for Pas. Mode help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:175
msgid ""
"<p><b>Max Port for Pas. Mode</b><br>\n"
"Maximum value for a port range for passive connection replies.\n"
" This is used for protection by means of a firewall. \n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ພອດສູງສຸດສຳລັບໂໝດ Passive</b><br>\n"
"ຄ່າສູງສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງພອດສຳລັບການຕອບກັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບ passive.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອການປ້ອງກັນຜ່ານໄຟວໍ (firewall).\n"
"</p>\n"

#. expert settings  Enable SSL help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:182
msgid ""
"<p><b>Enable SSL</b><br>\n"
"If enabled, SSL connections are allowed.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ເປີດໃຊ້ SSL</b><br>\n"
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບ SSL.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. expert settings Enable TLS  help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:188
msgid ""
"<p><b>Enable TLS</b><br>\n"
"If enabled, TLS connections are allowed.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ເປີດໃຊ້ TLS</b><br>\n"
"ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບ TLS.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. expert settings RSA Certificate to Use for SSL Encrypted Connections help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:194
msgid ""
"<p><b>RSA Certificate to Use for SSL-encrypted Connections</b><br>\n"
"This option specifies the location of the RSA certificate to \n"
"use for SSL-encrypted connections. Select a file by pressing <b>Browse</b>.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ RSA ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ SSL</b><br>\n"
"ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ RSA ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ \n"
"ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ SSL. ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ໂດຍການກົດ <b>ເລືອກເບິ່ງ</b>.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. expert settings Disable Downloading Unvalidated Data help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:201
msgid ""
"<p><b>Disable Downloading Unvalidated Data</b><br>\n"
"Disallow downloading of files that were uploaded \n"
"but not validated by a local admin.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ປິດການດາວໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການກວດສອບ</b><br>\n"
"ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກອັບໂຫຼດມາ \n"
"ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການກວດສອບໂດຍຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. expert settings Security Settings help 1/1
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:208
msgid ""
"<p><b>Security Settings</b><br>\n"
"<i>Disable SSL/TLS</i> Disable SSL/TLS encryption layer.\n"
"<i>Accept SSL and TLS</i> Accept both, traditional and encrypted sessions.\n"
"<i>Refuse Connections Without SSL/TLS</i> Refuse connections that do not use "
"SSL/TLS security mechanisms, including anonymous sessions.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມປອດໄພ</b><br>\n"
"<i>ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ SSL/TLS</i> ປິດການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ SSL/TLS.\n"
"<i>ຍອມຮັບ SSL ແລະ TLS</i> ຍອມຮັບທັງແບບປົກກະຕິ ແລະ ແບບເຂົ້າລະຫັດ.\n"
"<i>ປະຕິເສດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ບໍ່ມີ SSL/TLS</i> ປະຕິເສດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຄວາມປອດໄພແບບ SSL/TLS, ລວ"
"ມທັງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບທົ່ວໄປ.\n"
"</p>"

#. -----------================= SUMMARY =============----------
#.
#. Summary dialog help 1/3
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:219
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>FTP Server Configuration</big></b><br>\n"
"Configure the FTP server.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການກຳນົດຄ່າເຊີເວີ FTP</big></b><br>\n"
"ກຳນົດຄ່າເຊີເວີ FTP.<br></p>\n"

#. Summary dialog help 2/3
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:223
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Adding an FTP Server:</big></b><br>\n"
"Choose an FTP server from the list of detected FTP servers.\n"
"If your FTP server was not detected, use <b>Other (not detected)</b>.\n"
"Then press <b>Configure</b>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການເພີ່ມເຊີເວີ FTP:</big></b><br>\n"
"ເລືອກເຊີເວີ FTP ຈາກລາຍການທີ່ກວດພົບ.\n"
"ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບເຊີເວີ FTP ຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ <b>ອື່ນໆ (ກວດບໍ່ພົບ)</b>.\n"
"ຈາກນັ້ນກົດ <b>ກຳນົດຄ່າ</b>.</p>\n"

#. Summary dialog help 3/3
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:230
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Editing or Deleting</big></b><br>\n"
"If you press <b>Edit</b>, an additional dialog in which to change\n"
"the configuration opens.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ລຶບ</big></b><br>\n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານກົດ <b>ແກ້ໄຂ</b>, ຈະມີກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງ\n"
"ການກຳນົດຄ່າເປີດຂຶ້ນມາ.</p>\n"

#. Ovreview dialog help 1/3
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:236
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>FTP Server Configuration Overview</big></b><br>\n"
"Obtain an overview of the installed FTP servers. Additionally,\n"
"edit their configurations.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ພາບລວມການກຳນົດຄ່າເຊີເວີ FTP</big></b><br>\n"
"ເບິ່ງພາບລວມຂອງເຊີເວີ FTP ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, \n"
"ຍັງສາມາດແກ້ໄຂການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງພວກມັນໄດ້.<br></p>\n"

#. Ovreview dialog help 2/3
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:242
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Adding a FTP Server</big></b><br>\n"
"Press <b>Add</b> to configure a FTP server.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການເພີ່ມເຊີເວີ FTP</big></b><br>\n"
"ກົດ <b>ເພີ່ມ</b> ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າເຊີເວີ FTP.</p>\n"

#. Ovreview dialog help 3/3
#: src/include/ftp-server/helps.rb:246
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Editing or Deleting</big></b><br>\n"
"Choose a FTP server to change or remove.\n"
"Then press <b>Edit</b> or <b>Delete</b> respectively.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ລຶບ</big></b><br>\n"
"ເລືອກເຊີເວີ FTP ທີ່ຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ລຶບອອກ.\n"
"ຈາກນັ້ນກົດ <b>ແກ້ໄຂ</b> ຫຼື <b>ລຶບ</b> ຕາມລໍາດັບ.</p>\n"

#. Handle function of "Browse"
